# Luxel library sprite — original art, Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# The Luxel wordmark standing on a flat lens of light, in the spirit of the
# old bouncing-screensaver logos. Six frames, one per tint (cyan, magenta,
# gold, lime, orange, violet), same pixels each: on its own it steps through
# them once a second, and a keyframe track can pick the tint per key instead —
# Bouncing Logo changes colour at every wall.
